rota lap 5117, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes; row 2 was already read today so I advanced by hand. The cardinal seat's own line, infusion(world') -> world', is the test this lap applied twice: the recovery must stay green on a second reading, and a comment is a declaration about a world nobody had run it against.
